OL,3,GNEWSAImmigration arrests after people
OL,4,Acome off boat
OL,5,
OL,6,FTen people have been arrested after a
OL,7,Fnumber of individuals were reported
OL,8,Fcoming off a small powerboat at a
OL,9,Fharbour in Cornwall, getting in a van
OL,10,Fand then leaving the area.
OL,12,FA Home Office spokesperson said police
OL,13,Fresponded quickly to an "isolated and
OL,14,Frare" incident at Mylor Harbour, near
OL,15,FFalmouth, on Sunday morning at about
OL,16,F03:00 BST.
OL,18,FIt confirmed 10 individuals were
OL,19,Farrested and another individual,
OL,20,Funderstood to be under 18, was referred
OL,21,Fto social services.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
